Subject: [PATCH] Fit Perlin cells and octaves to the frame size: Deforum
 crashes when they do not divide it

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BhiEzmwUbwDK67k3BY9b4Y
